<!DOCTYPE html>
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Abou Us";
}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - The Fork</title>
    <style>
            body {
                font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                color: #333;
                line-height: 1.6;
            }

            .about-section {
                max-width: 1100px;
                margin: 50px auto;
                padding: 20px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 40px;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }

            .about-text {
                flex: 1;
                min-width: 300px;
            }

            .about-image {
                flex: 1;
                min-width: 300px;
            }

                .about-image img {
                    width: 100%;
                    border-radius: 8px;
                }

            h2 {
                color: #b22222;
                font-size: 2.5rem;
                margin-bottom: 20px;
            }

            p {
                margin-bottom: 15px;
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <section class="about-section">
        <div class="about-text">
            <h2>Our Story</h2>
            <p>Welcome to <strong>The Fork</strong>, where tradition meets passion on every plate. Founded in 2010, our family-owned restaurant brings authentic Italian recipes straight to your neighborhood.</p>
            <p>We use only fresh, locally sourced ingredients and imported Italian cheeses to craft meals that feel like home. Come join our table and share the love of great food.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-image">
            <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSFQmy0mGjj7rELQv68VtpnzsGGk2zEDHQhNvkzD8thwg&s=10" alt="Cozy interior of The Fork">
        </div>
    </section>

</body>
</html>


